    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0616 = (v_0610 + v_0611)/2 - v_0609" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0616 = (v_0610 + v_0611)/2 - v_0609</expbody>
        <expresult> = -6.750</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Retained for whole-wall equilibrium; carried by the wall, not the ring [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0617 = v_0615*(Abs(v_0616) + v_0011)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0617 = v_0615*(Abs(v_0616) + v_0011)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 71.504</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Superseded tributary-eccentricity basis (D-070); comparison only [kip-in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0618 = v_0533*v_0105*v_0110*Abs(v_0609 - v_0107)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0618 = v_0533*v_0105*v_0110*Abs(v_0609 - v_0107)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.420</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Rigid-body axial redistribution; sign taken to increase the ring force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0619 = v_0615 + v_0618" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0619 = v_0615 + v_0618</expbody>
        <expresult> = 7.754</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 design force [kip]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0620 = v_0112/v_0619" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0620 = v_0112/v_0619</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.463</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Compare with the kern limit [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0621 = v_0619/v_0071" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0621 = v_0619/v_0071</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.095</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qavg [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0622 = v_0112*v_0068/v_0072" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0622 = v_0112*v_0068/v_0072</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.009</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmoment [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0623 = v_0621 + v_0622" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0623 = v_0621 + v_0622</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.104</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmax [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0624 = v_0621 - v_0622" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0624 = v_0621 - v_0622</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.087</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 qmin [ksi]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0625 = v_0623*((v_0068^3 - v_0070^3)/(3*v_0066) - (v_0068^2 - v_0070^2)/2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0625 = v_0623*((v_0068^3 - v_0070^3)/(3*v_0066) - (v_0068^2 - v_0070^2)/2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.123</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Peak pressure over full radial strip [kip-in/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0626 = v_0623*(v_0068^2 - v_0070^2)/(2*v_0066)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0626 = v_0623*(v_0068^2 - v_0070^2)/(2*v_0066)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.134</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 root shear [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0627 = Sqrt(6*v_0625/(v_0040*v_0035))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0627 = Sqrt(6*v_0625/(v_0040*v_0035))</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.122</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 thickness bending [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0628 = v_0626/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0628 = v_0626/(v_0042*0.58*v_0035)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.005</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 thickness shear [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0629 = Max(v_0627, v_0628, v_0037 + 0.0625)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0629 = Max(v_0627, v_0628, v_0037 + 0.0625)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.375</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Bending, shear and conservative weld-edge allowance; revise/recalculate after selecting thickness [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0630 = v_0625/v_0034" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0630 = v_0625/v_0034</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.164</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Top/bottom weld couple separated conservatively by plate thickness [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0631 = Sqrt((v_0626/2)^2 + v_0630^2)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0631 = Sqrt((v_0626/2)^2 + v_0630^2)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.178</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Per fillet: half vertical shear + full radial couple force [kip/in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0632 = v_0069 + Sqrt(2)*v_0631/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
        <expbody>v_0632 = v_0069 + Sqrt(2)*v_0631/(v_0041*0.6*v_0038)</expbody>
        <expresult> = 0.070</expresult>
      </dynexp>
    </paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">ring 5 4 weld strength leg [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
